      "Solo presente",
      "Solo futuro"
     ],
     "answer": 0,
     "rule": "El CONDICIONAL MIXTO combina tiempos: condición pasada + resultado presente (If I had saved, I would have money now) o condición presente + resultado pasado (If I were richer, I would have bought it). wish + would se usa para quejarse de algo molesto que otra persona hace: I wish he would listen.",
